{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o112a","title":"郭嘉赞成北征乌丸","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o112a-account","label":"正文","text":"诸将担心北征时刘备劝刘表袭许，郭嘉判断刘表不能任用刘备，劝曹操出征。","evidence":["wudi-e-o112a-q"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-c5a61192c86df416bb29","label":"正文","text":"嘉料胡不设备劝太祖猝击乌丸","evidence":["chengguo-q-bebb6e429eaf8451d1bc"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"筹划北征","evidence":["wudi-e-o112a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0144","role":"进策","evidence":["wudi-e-o112a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"征讨对象","evidence":["wudi-e-o112a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"建安十二年北征前","year":207,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o112a-q","wudi-q-o111","wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df"],"chronology":"wudi-y207","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o111","basis":"建安十二年北征前","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,632,"O112a"],"order":252}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0144","name":"郭嘉","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0198","name":"袁尚","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-bebb6e429eaf8451d1bc","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-55586c7cf2d6a29214ad","layer":"original","quote":"太祖将征袁尚及三郡乌丸，诸下多惧刘表使刘备袭许〖3〗，以讨太祖。嘉曰：“公虽威震天下，胡恃其远〖4〗，必不设备。因其无备，猝然击之，可破灭也。且袁绍有恩于民夷〖5〗，而尚兄弟生存。今四州之民〖6〗，徒以威附〖7〗，德施未加；舍而南征，尚因乌丸之资，招其死主之臣〖8〗；胡人一动，民夷俱应；以生蹋顿之心〖9〗，成觊觎之计：恐青、冀非己之有也。表，坐谈客耳。自知才不足以御备：重任之则恐不能制，轻任之则备不为用。虽虚国远征，公无忧矣！”太祖遂行。","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":221,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o112a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e75946c5ecb5fc02ba8f","layer":"original","quote":"将北征三郡乌丸，诸将皆曰：“袁尚，亡虏耳。夷狄贪而无亲，岂能为尚用？今深入征之，刘备必说刘表以袭许；万一为变，事不可悔！”唯郭嘉策表必不能任备〖1〗，劝公行。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":631,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十二年：建安十二年（公元 207）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":623,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-20efb4f3aff50357a189","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o111","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01eaf58b917a530c61d5","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春二月〖1〗，公自淳于还邺。丁酉〖2〗，令曰：“吾起义兵诛暴乱，于今十九年；所征必克，岂吾功哉？乃贤士大夫之力也！天下虽未悉定，吾当要与贤士大夫共定之；而专享其劳〖3〗，吾何以安焉？其促定功行封〖4〗。”于是大封功臣二十余人，皆为列侯；其余各以次受封；及复死事之孤〖5〗：轻重各有差〖6〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":621,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
